<div
  class="lg:col-span-6 rounded-xl bg-surface-container-lowest p-space-2xl shadow-sm flex flex-col justify-between"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col gap-space-md">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-space-sm">
        <span
          class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-surface-container flex items-center justify-center text-primary"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[22px]">badge</span>
        </span>
        <div class="flex flex-col">
          <h3 class="font-headline-sm text-headline-sm text-on-surface">
            Datos Fiscales de Facturación
          </h3>
          <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
            >Información incluida en tus recibos oficiales descargables</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
      <span
        class="px-space-sm py-space-xxs rounded-full bg-primary-fixed text-on-primary-fixed-variant font-label-sm text-label-sm font-semibold"
        >Validado</span
      >
    </div>

    <div
      class="flex flex-col gap-space-sm p-space-md rounded-xl bg-surface-container-low mt-space-sm"
    >
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-space-xxs">
        <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
          >Razón Social</span
        >
        <span
          class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface text-right font-medium"
          >Main Street Cafe S.L.</span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-space-xxs">
        <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
          >Identificador Fiscal (NIF / RFC)</span
        >
        <span
          class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface text-right font-mono"
          >B-87654321</span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-center py-space-xxs">
        <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
          >Correo Electrónico de Facturas</span
        >
        <span class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface text-right"
          >facturacion@mainst.com</span
        >
      </div>
      <div class="flex justify-between items-start py-space-xxs">
        <span class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant"
          >Dirección Registrada</span
        >
        <span
          class="font-label-md text-label-md text-on-surface text-right max-w-xs"
          >Calle Mayor 42, 28013 Madrid, España</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="font-body-sm text-body-sm text-on-surface-variant mt-space-xxs">
      Las facturas mensuales se emiten de forma automática con desglose de
      impuestos correspondiente a la Unión Europea.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="pt-space-lg mt-space-md flex justify-end">
    <button
      class="flex items-center gap-space-xs px-space-md py-space-sm rounded-lg bg-surface-container text-on-surface hover:bg-surface-container-high transition-colors font-label-lg text-label-lg cursor-pointer"
      type="button"
    >
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[18px]">edit_note</span>
      Editar Datos Fiscales
    </button>
  </div>
</div>
